{"type":"message","id":"48f8b2b2","parentId":"ceabec7e","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:25:07.227Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Friday, March 13th, 2026 — 7:25 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773357907226}}
{"type":"message","id":"73c3ddc6","parentId":"48f8b2b2","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:25:14.708Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个定时任务，要求执行自动进化任务。让我分析一下需要做什么：\n\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\n当前时间是 2026年3月13日（星期五）。\n\n首先，我需要检查是否有 clawhub 相关的技能。看到有一个 skill 叫 \"clawhub\"，描述是\"Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com\"。这正是我需要的！\n\n让我先读取这个技能文件，了解如何使用 ClawHub CLI。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行这个自动进化任务。首先读取 ClawHub 技能指南。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_19d260edfea34e208e33d15a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12001,"output":212,"cacheRead":3456,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15669,"cost":{"input":0.012001,"output":0.0006784,"cacheRead":0.0006912000000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0133706}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773357907227}}
{"type":"message","id":"773907e6","parentId":"73c3ddc6","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:25:14.713Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_19d260edfea34e208e33d15a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773357914712}}
{"type":"message","id":"c177634c","parentId":"773907e6","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:25:23.116Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我了解了 ClawHub CLI 的使用方法。现在我需要：\n\n1. 使用 `clawhub search` 搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 使用 `clawhub install` 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成报告记录到 memory/evolution-2026-03-13.md\n\n让我开始搜索。我会搜索多个关键词。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_db114588b2e94f10bc5cd909","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search calendar --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search calendar"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ac2199e9c72d4aa0b7e9f2f5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search task --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search task"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f592d261b34244f59c94702d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search document --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search document"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a776ccb2484e4375bdf39465","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search meeting --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search meeting"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c6a5826ebd524b6099fbf955","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search email --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search email"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e6f78348905e4dd0a44c1c0d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search notes --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search notes"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e0b7553e9f554e94a34a3e94","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search productivity --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search productivity"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_93e5357a02024caba08b3b71","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search automation --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search automation"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":691,"output":304,"cacheRead":15424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16419,"cost":{"input":0.000691,"output":0.0009728000000000001,